## SketchUp Ruby API — Verify Everything
The SketchUp Ruby API is nightmarishly brittle. It is **Not Standard Ruby**. Do not assume regular Ruby language principles apply — the SketchUp flavour regularly breaks expectations.

**When in doubt, always check:** https://ruby.sketchup.com/
This is the **definitive and only trusted source**. Not Stack Overflow. Not memory. Not assumptions.

**Before writing or calling any method:**
- Confirm it actually exists in the docs.
- Never invent or assume an API method exists — if you cannot find it at ruby.sketchup.com, it does not exist.
